# v0.11.2：用户本机的桌面/UI 截图（不是构建产物、也不进仓库；文件留在盘上）
# docs/images/ used to be fully ignored (local screendump junk lands there).
# README now references the freshly captured screenshots, so: ignore everything
# in the dir EXCEPT the 9 README shots named 0X_*.png.
